Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:12.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《加勒比海盗：黑珍珠号的诅咒》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:33.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 让我们痛饮吧 兄弟们 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Drink up, me hearties, yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 烧杀抢掠是我们的乐趣 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ We kidnap and ravage and don't give a hoot ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:42.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 让我们痛饮吧 兄弟们 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Drink up, me hearties, yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:45.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 哟呼 哟呼 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo ho, yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我是一个海盗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A pirate's life for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:53.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 所以我勒索 我偷窃 我毫不在乎 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ We extort, we pilfer, we filch and sack ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 干杯吧 朋友 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Drink up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:56.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要唱了 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet, missy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿常有海盗出没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cursed pirates sail these waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不想引他们来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to bring them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 吉布斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gibbs, that will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在唱海盗的歌呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was singing about pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:07.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这不寻常的浓雾里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad luck to be singing about pirates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:09.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唱着海盗的歌会给我们带来厄运的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with us mired in this unnatural fog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住我的话吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark my words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经记住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider them marked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去干你的活吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.43,0:01:16.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 上尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:19.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带女人上船总会带来厄运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad luck to have a woman on board, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是这么小的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even a miniature one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得如果能遇上海盗的话 也会是一件值得兴奋的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it'd be rather exciting to meet a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再想想吧 斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think again, Miss Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是卑鄙且放荡的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vile and dissolute creatures, the lot of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果让我看到他们的旗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend that any man who sails under a pirate flag{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.41,0:01:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是他们的衣服的话 我会毫不犹豫地给他们应有的惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or wears a pirate brand gets what he deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.35,0:01:41.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们在绞刑架上就这么一落一停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A short drop and a sudden stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:46.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿上尉 我对此表示感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Norrington, I appreciate your fervor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我担心这会对我女儿产生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm concerned about the effect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this subject will have upon my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 斯旺市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My apologies, Governor Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:55.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我觉得这都挺有趣的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I find it all fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:01:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所担心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. That's what concerns me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看! 那儿有个男孩在水面上漂着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! A boy! There's a boy in the water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人落水了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man overboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:36.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把绳子放下去 拿钩子来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man the ropes. Fetch a hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他拉上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haul him aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:48.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还有呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:51.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary, Mother of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁它需要有一定量的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the powder magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:04.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,商船一般都有很好的武装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merchant vessels run heavily armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们可真客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of good it did them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:11.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说出每个人所想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's thinking it. I'm just saying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:17.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能 一般来说这只是一个意外事故{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no proof of that. It's probably an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:20.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向船长预警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rouse the captain immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:23.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备全速航行 起航!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave to and take in sail. Launch the boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白 我希望你陪着那男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth, I want you to accompany the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你负责照料他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be in your charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:33.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.81,0:03:57.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫伊丽莎白 斯旺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Elizabeth Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:04:00.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会照顾你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm watching over you, Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:18.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has he said anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道他叫威尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name's William Turner. That's all I found out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带到船舱去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:36.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿好衣服了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you decent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还在睡?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still abed at this hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美好的一天!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's a beautiful day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个礼物要送你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a gift for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太漂亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lsn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:05.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么特别的理由吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I inquire as to the occasion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道一个父亲送给女儿礼物还要什么理由吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does a father need an occasion to dote upon his daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, l...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:19.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能在今天的典礼上穿着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped you might wear it for the ceremony today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,典礼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ceremony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿上校的升职典礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Norrington's promotion ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:25.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他将成为诺灵顿准将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore Norrington, as he's about to become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:31.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个不错的绅士 你觉得呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fine gentleman, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:33.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fancies you, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:36.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白? 感觉怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth? How's it coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:39.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很难说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's difficult to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是伦敦最流行的款式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told it's the latest fashion in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么伦敦的女人一定不用呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, women in London must've learnt not to breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爷 你有一个客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Milord, you have a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.01,0:07:08.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能再见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿来了你要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have your order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:20.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:22.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刀刃是钢质的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blade is folded steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在刀柄处镶有金子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gold filigree laid into the handle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完美的平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly balanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柄脚和刀刃基本同宽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tang is nearly the full width of the blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 太美妙了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lmpressive. Very impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:41.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿准将一定会很满意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore Norrington is going to be very pleased with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向你的师傅表达我对他的谢意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do pass my compliments on to your master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:55.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个工匠总希望自己的作品 能被人喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A craftsman is always pleased to hear his work is appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白 你看起来好美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth, you look absolutely stunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能见到你实在是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚梦见你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a dream about you last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样合适吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, is that entirely proper for you ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得我们相遇的那天吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the day we met. Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:15.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会忘记呢 斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I forget, Miss Swann?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你说多少次 叫我伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times must I ask you to call me Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最起码再多一次 斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least once more, Miss Swann, as always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.01,0:08:23.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:25.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子可懂礼貌多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least the boy has a sense of propriety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:29.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We really must be going. There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day, Mr. Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.57,0:08:42.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:12.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ... hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up, there, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要缴付一先令 才能让你的船停靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shilling to tie up your boat at the dock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你得告诉我你的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shall need to know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你三先令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say to three shillings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不要再讲名字的问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we forget the name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:36.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到皇家港 史密斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Port Royal, Mr. Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向前两步走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two paces march!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,向后转!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right about-face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:23.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿起武器!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一般民众不能进入这个码头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This dock is off limits to civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:52.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terribly sorry. I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我看到的话会告诉你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I see one, I shall inform you immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:02.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿似乎有不少好玩的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some sort of high-toned and fancy to-do up at the fort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:05.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么像你们这样出色的士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could it be two upstanding gentlemen such as yourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有权力进去观赏呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did not merit an invitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:11.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为需要有人来确保 一般民众不进入那码头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has to make sure this dock stays off limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个高尚的目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fine goal, to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:17.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我觉得那边的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it seems to me that a ship like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:20.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让这里的一艘相形见绌了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes this one here a bit superfluous, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:23.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无畏号是海上的霸主没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dauntless is the power in these waters, true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但以速度上来讲 没有船能比过拦截号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no ship as can match the Interceptor for speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过一艘更快的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard of one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他几乎是无法追上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's supposed to be very fast. Nigh uncatchable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有实际存在的船 能比得上拦截号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's no real ship as can match the Interceptor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠是实际存在的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Pearl is a real ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 它不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是的 我曾经看到过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is. I've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到过?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:51.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看过黑帆的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen a ship with black sails{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被一群混蛋水手和邪恶船长驾驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's crewed by the damned and captained by a man so evil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:02.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连地狱都不欢迎他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Hell itself spat him back out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我确实看过黑帆的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have seen a ship with black sails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有其他的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No ship that's not crewed by the damned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被一群混蛋水手和邪恶船长驾驶的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and captained by a man so evil that Hell spat him out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:17.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会有黑色的帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could possibly have black sails, therefore couldn't be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以除了黑珍珠不可能有别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any other ship than the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你想说的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you're saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:25.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, there's no real ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有实际存在的船赶得上拦截号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as can match the Interceptor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能来这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have permission to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:40.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 这船太美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. It's such a pretty boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,轮船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.66,0:13:42.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:45.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,史密斯 如果你愿意的话 史密西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smith. Or Smithy, if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来皇家港的目的是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your purpose in Port Royal, Mr. Smith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.80,0:13:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 不准说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. And no lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:53.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, I confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要霸占一艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my intention to commandeer one of these ships,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在托图加招一些水手烧杀抢掠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pick up a crew in Tortuga, raid, pillage, plunder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:00.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再把那些告密者杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and otherwise pilfer my weaselly black guts out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说过不许说谎 - 我觉得他说的是实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said no lies. - I think he's telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:07.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是实话的话 他就不会告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he were telling the truth, he wouldn't have told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:11.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就连是真话也不愿相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you wouldn't believe the truth even if he told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以过来一下吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很漂亮 伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look lovely, Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:42.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对我的直接表示抱歉 但我一定要说出我的心声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize if I seem forward, but I must speak my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:47.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次的晋升{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This promotion throws into sharp relief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:51.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使我如释重负{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that which I have not yet achieved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我期望娶一个好女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A marriage to a fine woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你就是那个好女人 伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have become a fine woman, Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能呼吸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:05.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm a bit nervous myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:09.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我被他们选为头领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then they made me their chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:13.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:16.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:19.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些岩石!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rocks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:22.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没掉在上面已经是奇迹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, it's a miracle she missed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会去救她吗? - 我不会游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you be saving her? - I can't swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是国王舰队的荣耀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pride of the King's Navy, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:33.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not lose these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:32.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在这儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:34.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有呼吸了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not breathing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可想不到会是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never would've thought of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显你没去过新加坡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clearly you've never been to Singapore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪里得到的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:04.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸爸 - 怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:14.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将 难道你要杀了我的救命恩人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore, do you really intend to kill my rescuer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信一次感谢已足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe thanks are in order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:31.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在东印度公司见过面 不是吗 海盗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a brush with the East lndia Trading Company, did we, pirate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他绑起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:38.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把枪对准他 吉雷特 拿些铁链来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your guns on him, men. Gillette, fetch some irons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:42.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 斯派洛 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 斯派洛船长 更确切一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow, if you please, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长 那么你的船呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't see your ship, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在寻找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the market, as it were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:52.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他要抢一艘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he'd come to commandeer one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:56.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过他说的是实话 这些东西是他的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you he was telling the truth. These are his, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No additional shot nor powder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会指北的指南针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A compass that doesn't point North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为这也是木头做的呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I half expected it to be made of wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:20.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你毫无疑问是我见过最差劲的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are without doubt the worst pirate I've ever heard of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你一定听说过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have heard of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将 我要抗议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore, I really must protest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:28.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点上尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carefully, Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:31.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他是不是海盗 它救过我的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate or not, this man saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:34.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一次善行掩盖不了他以前的恶迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One good deed is not enough to redeem a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:36.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他是罪无可恕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though it seems enough to condemn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lndeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:45.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你会帮我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd warm up to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿准将 我的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore Norrington, my effects, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.11,0:18:57.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你叫伊丽莎白? - 是斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt is Elizabeth, isn't it? - It's Miss Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我穿上它 斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Swann, if you'd be so kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:02.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 亲爱的 时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come, dear. We don't have all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if you'll be very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:24.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy on the goods, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个卑鄙小人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're despicable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:28.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好过去送死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sticks and stones, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:32.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我救你一命你还我一命 大家扯平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved your life. You save mine. We're square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:36.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 女士们 你们将永远记住这一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, milady, you will always remember this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:41.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们差点就抓住了杰克 斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the day that you almost caught Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:19:59.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在可以开枪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now will you shoot him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:03.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On his heels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我掩护你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:34.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉雷特 斯派洛先生和 绞刑架有一个约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gillette, Mr. Sparrow has a dawn appointment with the gallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:37.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望他迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would hate for him to miss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:43.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜楼上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search upstairs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仔细找!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look lively, men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:28.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:19.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没动过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right where I left you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被人动过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not where I left you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:40.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们在找的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one they're hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.63,0:22:43.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:46.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很面熟 我曾经威胁过你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem familiar. Have I threatened you before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:50.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不愿和海盗搭上关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make a point of avoiding familiarity with pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:53.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那对玷污你的记录感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be a shame to put a mark on your record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:55.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你允许的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you'll excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样做理智吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think this wise, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和一个海盗比剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crossing blades with a pirate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.62,0:23:06.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾试图伤害斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You threatened Miss Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:11.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一点点而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.04,0:23:28.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你执意要如此 我就陪你玩玩 剑术还不赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you're doing. I'll give you that. Excellent form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么脚步呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how's your footwork?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:32.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我走这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I step here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:34.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:36.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我再走一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I step again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.16,0:23:43.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这把戏看起来不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a wonderful trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:09.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是你阻挡了我逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except, once again, you are between me and my way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.62,0:24:12.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你现在已经没有武器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you have no weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.15,0:24:36.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些剑是谁造的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who makes all these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.35,0:24:39.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:44.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我每天都练三个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I practice with them three hours a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.89,0:24:47.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 你得为你自己找个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to find yourself a girl, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.10,0:24:57.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又或者你每天练三小时的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or perhaps the reason you practice three hours a day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你已经找到了一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you found one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.60,0:25:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过还没得到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and are otherwise incapable of wooing said strumpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.04,0:25:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是太监吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a eunuch, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.28,0:25:08.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天练三小时 是为了当我遇见一个海盗的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I practice three hours a day so when I meet a pirate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.48,0:25:09.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能亲手杀了他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can kill it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.06,0:26:28.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你耍手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cheated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.13,0:26:29.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.96,0:26:34.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:35.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.57,0:26:37.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 请走开 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please move. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:40.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不可以坐视你离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot just step aside and let you escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.84,0:26:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一枪本不是为你准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This shot is not meant for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.09,0:26:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:02.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做得很好 布朗先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent work, Mr. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.33,0:27:05.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮助我们抓到了一个逃犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've assisted in the capture of a fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.13,0:27:08.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是尽我的公民义务而已 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just doing my civic duty, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.50,0:27:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你一定会记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you will remember this is the day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:14.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一天杰克 斯派洛几乎逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow almost escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.81,0:27:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.84,0:27:23.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闻到了吗? - 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you smell it? - Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这儿有肉骨头 - 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's marrowbone. - Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.15,0:27:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看这美味的骨头 - 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Want a juicy bone? - Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.01,0:27:29.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 乖 过来 - 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come here, boy! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:33.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这样是没用的 那狗绝对不会过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can keep doing that forever. The dog is never going to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:35.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, excuse us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:38.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们还不想上绞刑架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we haven't resigned ourself to the gallows just yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.80,0:27:46.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:49.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的经历一定让你受惊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a difficult day for you, I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.27,0:27:51.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前就料到诺灵顿准将会向我求婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suspected Commodore Norrington would propose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.01,0:27:54.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是没有什么准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must admit, I wasn't prepared for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.64,0:27:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你被那个海盗挟持 听起来怪可怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant you being threatened by that pirate. Sounds terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.68,0:28:00.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.25,0:28:02.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是怪可怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it was terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿准将终于向你求婚了 真令人羡慕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the commodore proposed. Fancy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.42,0:28:09.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我直言 你们可真是郎才女貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's a smart match, miss, if it's not too bold to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.22,0:28:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a smart match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.03,0:28:14.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a fine man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:18.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个任何女人都想要嫁的好男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's what any woman should dream of marrying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.57,0:28:22.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过那个威尔 特纳也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that Will Turner. He's a fine man, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.90,0:28:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这有点过分了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is too bold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.90,0:28:28.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 小姐 我想我还是走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, begging your pardon, miss. It was not my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.62,0:29:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的女儿给你答复了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has my daughter given you an answer yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.63,0:29:22.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she hasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:25.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天对她来说可不容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she has had a very trying day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坏天气 你觉得呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ghastly weather, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常阴冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bleak. Very bleak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.34,0:29:34.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.51,0:29:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,炮弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cannon fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.58,0:29:39.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还击!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.75,0:29:42.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道是谁 - 全副武装!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know those guns. - Men to arms!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.75,0:29:49.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.82,0:29:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.83,0:29:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过它的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.73,0:29:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它到处抢掠已有十多年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been preying on ships and settlements for near 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.57,0:30:01.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有一个生还者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never leaves any survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.17,0:30:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有生还者?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:06.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那这些故事是从哪儿来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then where do the stories come from, I wonder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.21,0:30:46.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.61,0:31:19.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:39.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看清那些亮点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sight the muzzle flash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.97,0:31:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准亮点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim for the flashes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.20,0:31:43.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要对整艘船进行炮轰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a full strike, fore and aft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.14,0:31:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,施蒂芬斯 再多点弹药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stephens, more cartridges!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.77,0:31:49.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去我的办公室躲起来 市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Governor, barricade yourself in my office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.04,0:31:53.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是命令!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.90,0:32:12.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.30,0:32:14.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, chum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:21.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.52,0:32:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯旺小姐 他们来绑架你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Swann, they've come to kidnap you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.15,0:32:32.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.92,0:32:34.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是市长的女儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the governor's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:36.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没有看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. They haven't seen you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.59,0:32:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑去堡垒那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first chance you get, run to the fort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:52.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.81,0:33:00.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要! 好烫啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No! It's hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.18,0:33:01.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢烧我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burned me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.08,0:33:35.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:49.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子 我知道你在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you're here, poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:50.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.06,0:33:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧 我们不会伤害你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out and we promise we won't hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:56.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恩?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:34:01.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到你的 乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will find you, poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.44,0:34:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你手里的东西召唤我们来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got something of ours, and it calls to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:15.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那金子在召唤我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gold calls to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.09,0:34:17.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.86,0:34:25.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.10,0:34:27.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.17,0:34:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.87,0:34:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:31.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我请求帕雷的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I invoke the right of parley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.27,0:34:34.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据摩根和巴塞洛缪制定的海盗法典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the Code of the Brethren set down by the pirates Morgan and Bartholomew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:36.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须带我去见你们的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to take me to your captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.11,0:34:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过法典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.78,0:34:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果俘虏要求帕雷的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If an adversary demands parley,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.41,0:34:41.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能伤害她直至仪式结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can do them no harm until the parley is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.78,0:34:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让法典见鬼去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To blazes with the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.15,0:34:46.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她想要见船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants to be taken to the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.89,0:34:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以任何人都不可以阻挠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she'll go without a fuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.22,0:34:53.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须遵照法典行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must honor the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.94,0:35:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说再见吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:11.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.98,0:35:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 威尔! - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:17.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.59,0:35:28.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开人渣!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of my way, scum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.71,0:35:42.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起了朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sympathies, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.21,0:35:44.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你不怎么走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no manner of luck at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狗儿 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, doggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.63,0:36:09.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在只有我们俩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just you and me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.57,0:36:11.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有你和我了 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you and old Jack. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:13.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. That's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.81,0:36:15.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子 尝尝这骨头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy. Come get the bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.04,0:36:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是个好孩子 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good boy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.71,0:36:19.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再近一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit closer. A bit closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:21.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 乖狗儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. That's it, doggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:25.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 你这污秽的杂种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you filthy, slimy, mangy cur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.39,0:36:29.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不! 我不是这个意思!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! I didn't mean it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.32,0:36:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.16,0:36:39.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是军械库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.20,0:36:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这是谁 提格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well. Look what we have here, Twigg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.54,0:36:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.77,0:36:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最后一次见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I saw you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.01,0:36:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人在一个要命的荒岛上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were all alone on a godforsaken island,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的视野中慢慢消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shrinking into the distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:59.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你的厄运还没有结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His fortunes aren't improved much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.52,0:37:02.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,顾好你们自己吧 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worry about your own fortunes, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱的最底层 是为你们这些叛徒准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deepest circle of hell is reserved for betrayers and mutineers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.56,0:37:13.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是那咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there is a curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.33,0:37:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.47,0:37:19.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know nothing of hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.41,0:37:29.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太有趣了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.58,0:38:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没料到我们会有俘虏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know we was taking on captives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.49,0:38:10.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她要求行使帕雷的权利 所以我们带她来见巴伯萨船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's invoked the right of parley with Captain Barbossa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.72,0:38:14.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我来这儿是... - 让你开口的时候你再开口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm here to ... - You'll speak when spoken to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.53,0:38:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望再看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ye will not lay a hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.06,0:38:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些被帕雷保护着的人受到威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on those under the protection of parley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.63,0:38:22.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.74,0:38:27.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对此表示抱歉 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My apologies, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.57,0:38:30.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴伯萨船长 我是来谈判的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Barbossa, I am here to negotiate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.84,0:38:33.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你们停止攻击皇家港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the cessation of hostilities against Port Royal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.01,0:38:36.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好冗长的句子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were a lot of long words in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:39.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只不过是一些出身低微的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're naught but humble pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.49,0:38:41.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简单点吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it that you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.19,0:38:43.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你们离开 并且永远不要回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to leave and never come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.93,0:38:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我倾向于拒绝你的要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm disinclined to acquiesce to your request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.80,0:38:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说"不"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means "no."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.83,0:38:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:38:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我就扔了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好紧张阿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me holds are bursting with swag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.78,0:39:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这闪闪发光的东西对我们很重要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bit of shine matters to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:10.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.32,0:39:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们要找的 我认得这艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what you've been searching for. I recognize this ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.25,0:39:17.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在八年前见过它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it eight years ago on the crossing from England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.39,0:39:19.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.49,0:39:23.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.36,0:39:25.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想既然它没什么意义的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose if it is worthless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.16,0:39:27.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有理由再留着它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no point in me keeping it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.01,0:39:41.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字 小姐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a name, missy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.41,0:39:45.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是市长家的一个女仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a maid in the governor's household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.42,0:39:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系带王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bootstrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:03.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个女仆怎会有如此珍贵的东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does a maid own a trinket such as that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.47,0:40:06.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,家族继承的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family heirloom, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.97,0:40:09.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是偷的 如果你的意思的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't steal it, if that's what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.98,0:40:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 把它给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Hand it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.41,0:40:15.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会离开你的城市永远不再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll put your town to our rudder and ne'er return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.56,0:40:30.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的协议呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our bargain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停止开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still the guns and stow them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.17,0:40:39.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下! 你得把我送上岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! You have to take me to shore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.24,0:40:40.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根据法典的规定…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the Code ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.67,0:40:45.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 我们的协议并不包括把你送上岸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, your return to shore was not part of our agreement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:46.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我没有这个义务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I must do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.68,0:40:49.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第二 你必须是一个海盗 法典才会对你生效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be a pirate for the Pirate's Code to apply,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.68,0:40:50.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:54.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第三 法典只不过是一些指导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirdly, the Code is more what you'd call guidelines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.42,0:40:56.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它并不是必须遵守的规定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than actual rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.16,0:40:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳小姐 欢迎来到黑珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard the Black Pearl, Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.55,0:41:22.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们抢走了她 他们把伊丽莎白抢走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken her. They've taken Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.02,0:41:26.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫托先生 把这个人带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Murtogg, remove this man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.22,0:41:28.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要抓住他们 我们一定要救她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to hunt them down. We must save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.82,0:41:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们该怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where do you propose we start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.42,0:41:34.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有有关我女儿的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have information concerning my daughter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.13,0:41:36.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please share it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.56,0:41:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个杰克 斯派洛提起过黑珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Jack Sparrow. He talked about the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.80,0:41:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是提起而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mentioned it is more what he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.34,0:41:48.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问他试试看 他也许会带我们去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him where it is. He could lead us to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.41,0:41:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 那些攻击我们的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The pirates who invaded this fort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.94,0:41:56.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并没有救走他 所以他们不可能是一伙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}left Sparrow locked in his cell, ergo they are not his allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.48,0:41:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会试着去找到他们可能的航线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will establish their most likely course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.45,0:42:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不够!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not good enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.42,0:42:05.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生 你不是一个军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Turner, you are not a military man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.32,0:42:06.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是一个水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not a sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.03,0:42:09.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只不过是一个铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.43,0:42:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且这不是意气用事的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is not the moment for rash actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.67,0:42:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要以为你是唯一一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not make the mistake of thinking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.34,0:42:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,担心伊丽莎白的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the only man here who cares for Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.69,0:42:36.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对那艘黑珍珠很熟吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are familiar with that ship. The Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.79,0:42:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.79,0:42:41.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它会在哪里停靠?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does it make berth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.39,0:42:43.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you not heard the stories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.33,0:42:49.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴伯萨船长和他那群走狗的故事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Barbossa and his crew of miscreants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.34,0:42:51.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来自死亡之岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sail from the dreaded lsla de Muerta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.04,0:42:53.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个除了去过那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an island that cannot be found,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.71,0:42:57.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有其他人能够找得到的小岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except by those who already know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.64,0:43:00.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘船是存在的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship's real enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.15,0:43:02.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以它停靠的地方也一定存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lts anchorage must be a real place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.15,0:43:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.62,0:43:05.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么问我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why ask me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.75,0:43:07.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.29,0:43:10.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你自己也想成为海盗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want to turn pirate yourself, is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.22,0:43:12.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.89,0:43:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们带走了斯旺小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took Miss Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.20,0:43:19.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你终于找到了你的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so it is that you found a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.63,0:43:22.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 不过你要英雄救美的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. Well, if you're intending to brave all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.84,0:43:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要获得她的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hasten to her rescue, and so win fair lady's heart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.14,0:43:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须一个人去做 朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll have to do it alone, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:31.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不出这对我会有任何好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see no profit in it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.98,0:43:33.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能把你救出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么救? 已经没有钥匙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that? They key's run off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:37.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这牢房是我造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped build these cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是半固定的铁链{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are half-pin barrel hinges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.09,0:43:44.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用杠杆原理和一些巧力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the right leverage and the proper application of strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.42,0:43:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就能轻松地把它抬起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door will lift free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.19,0:43:51.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.30,0:43:53.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.60,0:43:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是威廉的缩写是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be short for William, I imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.07,0:43:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, strong name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.24,0:44:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问是随你父亲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt named for your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.87,0:44:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.04,0:44:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.71,0:44:09.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生 我改变了我的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Mr. Turner, I've changed me mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.08,0:44:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能把我救出去的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you spring me from this cell, I swear on pain of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.42,0:44:14.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会不顾一切把你带到黑珍珠上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall take you to the Black Pearl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.45,0:44:16.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去见你的心肝宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your bonny lass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.62,0:44:18.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们就有了约定?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have an accord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.79,0:44:22.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.53,0:44:23.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:25.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我弄出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.23,0:44:29.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快一点 有人会听见的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry. Someone will have heard that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.84,0:44:32.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能忘了我的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without my effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.58,0:44:40.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去偷船?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to steal the ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.18,0:44:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那条?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.02,0:44:44.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,霸占{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commandeer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.88,0:44:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去抢那艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to commandeer that ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.22,0:44:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的行话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nautical term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:51.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One question about your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.19,0:44:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们也没有出发的必要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or there's no use going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.62,0:44:54.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了那个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.33,0:44:56.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以牺牲到怎样的程度?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far are you willing to go to save her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.06,0:44:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为她去死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd die for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.56,0:44:59.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.90,0:45:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就没什么疑问了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No worries, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.75,0:45:24.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂和伟大之间只有一线之隔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is either madness or brilliance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.19,0:45:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们往往是相伴而行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's remarkable how often those two traits coincide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.29,0:46:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家不要惊慌! 我们已经控制了这条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone stay calm! We are taking over the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.26,0:46:03.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye! Avast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.16,0:46:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个人是驾驭不了这条船的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship cannot be crewed by two men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.33,0:46:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远也开不出这个码头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never make it out of the bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.07,0:46:16.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 我是斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, I'm Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.81,0:46:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.91,0:46:22.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.02,0:46:25.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 他们抢走了无畏号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, they've taken the Dauntless!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.39,0:46:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.19,0:46:31.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把船抢走了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken the ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.76,0:46:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛和特纳把无畏号抢走了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sparrow and Turner have taken the Dauntless!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:37.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳 你太鲁莽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rash, Turner. Too rash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.73,0:46:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问他是我见过的最难缠的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is without doubt the worst pirate I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.04,0:46:47.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.21,0:46:55.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,转舵! 转舵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her around! Bring her around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.19,0:47:05.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全面搜查这艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search every cabin, every hull, down to the bilges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.27,0:47:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水手们 快回去拦截号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sailors, back to the Interceptor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.17,0:47:23.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:33.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 准将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Commodore, for getting us ready to make way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为我们省了不少力气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd have had a hard time of it by ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.06,0:47:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扬帆全速航行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set topsails and clear up this mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.49,0:47:43.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在有风的情况下我们根本追不上它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the wind, we won't catch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.50,0:47:46.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不想追上它 只要让它进入我们的射程范围之内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need to. Get them in range of the long nines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.37,0:47:48.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands, come about!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.20,0:47:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伸出炮头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run out the guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.44,0:47:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要击毁自己的船 长官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are to fire on our own ship, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.11,0:47:55.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿看到它沉睡在海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather see her at the bottom of the ocean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.17,0:47:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不能让他落入海盗的手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than in the hands of a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.21,0:48:02.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将 他把舵给定死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore, he's disabled the rudder chain, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.28,0:48:07.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弃船!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.63,0:48:17.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我见过最厉害的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's got to be the best pirate I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.30,0:48:19.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it would seem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.44,0:48:30.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我还是个小孩的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}WlLL: When I was a lad living in England,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.54,0:48:32.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈一个人把我拉扯大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my mother raised me by herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.54,0:48:37.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她死了之后 我就来这儿找我爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After she died, I came out here, looking for my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.78,0:48:39.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.75,0:48:43.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的爸爸 威尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father, Will Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.75,0:48:46.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是听了他的名字之后才决定帮我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only after you learnt my name you agreed to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.82,0:48:49.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这也是我所希望的 所以我也没有深究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since that's what I wanted, I didn't press the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.26,0:48:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是傻子 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a simpleton, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.33,0:48:53.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.37,0:49:00.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 我认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.70,0:49:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是少数几个 知道他叫威廉特纳的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably one of the few who knew him as William Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.94,0:49:07.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分人都叫他系带王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone else called him Bootstrap or Bootstrap Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.11,0:49:08.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,系带王?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bootstrap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.01,0:49:11.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个好人 一个好海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good man. Good pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.65,0:49:13.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 你简直和他长得一模一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, you look just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.82,0:49:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.92,0:49:16.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个跑货运的水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a merchant sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.89,0:49:19.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个可敬守法的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A respectable man who obeyed the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.12,0:49:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个凶残的海盗 一个恶棍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a bloody pirate. A scallywag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.63,0:49:26.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲不是海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was not a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.56,0:49:30.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下它 孩子 不值得再被痛扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it away, son. It's not worth you getting beat again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.63,0:49:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来不按规则格斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ignored the rules of engagement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.64,0:49:35.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我早杀了你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a fair fight, I'd kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.21,0:49:38.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有必要按规矩交战 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that's not much incentive for me to fight fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.35,0:49:48.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你还吊在那里 就听好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, as long as you're just hanging there, pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.75,0:49:51.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真正唯一的规则是:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only rules that really matter are these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人可以做什么 人无法做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a man can do and what a man can't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.23,0:49:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,例如{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.66,0:50:00.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以认为你父亲是个海盗 同时又是个好人 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can accept that your father was a pirate and a good man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.23,0:50:01.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...或者你无法接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.47,0:50:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子你有海盗血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate is in your blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.97,0:50:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你迟早会同流合污的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you'll have to square with that someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.64,0:50:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而比如我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, me, for example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.87,0:50:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以淹死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can let you drown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.84,0:50:11.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我无法单靠自己航行到特图加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't bring this ship into Tortuga{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.14,0:50:12.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all by me onesy, savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.64,0:50:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.82,0:50:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能在一个海盗的指挥下开船...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you sail under the command of a pirate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.42,0:50:25.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...还是不能?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or can you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.46,0:50:29.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特图加?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tortuga?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.43,0:50:30.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特图加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tortuga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.95,0:50:55.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更主要的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More importantly, it is indeed a sad life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.55,0:50:58.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人从来没有领略过 特图加多姿多彩是令人悲伤的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has never breathed deep this sweet bouquet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.59,0:51:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is Tortuga, savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.83,0:51:03.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.33,0:51:08.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还算不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt'll linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.47,0:51:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来告诉你吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you, mate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.23,0:51:13.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果世界上每个城镇都像这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if every town in the world were like this one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.10,0:51:16.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将再没有人会感到失落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no man would ever feel unwanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.54,0:51:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯卡赖特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scarlett!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.11,0:51:22.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这巴掌是给我的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sure I deserved that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.08,0:51:24.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉塞尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giselle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.48,0:51:25.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.48,0:51:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.85,0:51:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这巴掌是我活该被打的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have deserved that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.26,0:51:35.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 你这个懒惰碎嘴的白痴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curse you for breathing, you slack-jawed idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.83,0:51:39.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母爱!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother's love!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.77,0:51:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在弄醒一个人之前 你应该掂量清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should know better than to wake a man when he's sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.07,0:51:46.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会招来厄运的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.47,0:51:48.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 还好我懂得应付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, I know how to counter it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.84,0:51:50.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,清醒的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who did the waking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.17,0:51:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给迷迷糊糊的人买了杯酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buys the man who was sleeping a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.51,0:51:55.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迷迷糊糊的人一边喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who was sleeping drinks while listening to a proposition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.38,0:51:57.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一边听着清醒人的建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the man who did the waking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.75,0:52:02.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 那就开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, that'll about do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.56,0:52:08.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的! 我已经醒了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast! I'm already awake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.86,0:52:10.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了清洗那种气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was for the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.67,0:52:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留意周围!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep a sharp eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.35,0:52:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什么冒险?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what's the nature of this venture of yourn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.72,0:52:36.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找黑珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going after the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.76,0:52:45.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他要在哪里出现 所以我要去把它夺回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where it's going to be, and I'm gonna take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.26,0:52:48.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 这可是傻瓜干的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, it's a fool's errand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.50,0:52:51.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你比我更了解黑珍珠的传说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know better than me the tales of the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.90,0:52:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我更了解巴博萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I know what Barbossa is up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.07,0:52:57.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要一船水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I need is a crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.54,0:52:59.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据闻巴博萨船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what I hear of Barbossa,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.14,0:53:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会冒傻乎乎的险 也不会听人教唆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's not a man to suffer fools, nor strike a bargain with one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.05,0:53:04.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 我不是个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say it's a good thing I'm not a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.58,0:53:06.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove me wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.25,0:53:09.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你凭什么认为巴博萨会还给你船?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think Barbossa will give up his ship to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.82,0:53:12.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以说这是种互惠互利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say it's a matter of leverage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.37,0:53:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.94,0:53:35.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是‘系带王’特纳的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the child of Bootstrap Bill Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.05,0:53:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他唯一的孩子 知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His only child, savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.58,0:53:40.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还是唯一的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.42,0:53:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说互惠互利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Leverage," says you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.89,0:53:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说情况已变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"l think I feel a change in the wind," says l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.89,0:53:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到船员的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find us a crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.53,0:53:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定有些像你一样疯狂的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's bound to be some sailors crazy as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.36,0:53:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有希望 就要尽全力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One can only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.63,0:53:56.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用我们的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take what you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.80,0:53:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去做赌注!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give nothing back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.26,0:54:25.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将和船长共进晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be dining with the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.23,0:54:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要求你穿上这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he requests you wear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.43,0:54:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell the captain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.70,0:54:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会听命于他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am disinclined to acquiesce to his request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.17,0:54:35.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说你会这么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.61,0:54:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还说如果情况是那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also said, if that be the case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.14,0:54:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将和船员们共进晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be dining with the crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.04,0:54:42.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...一丝不挂的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll be naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.18,0:54:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.80,0:55:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是什么庆祝晚宴 也没必要顾及他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need to stand on ceremony, nor call to impress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.61,0:55:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.36,0:55:31.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝这酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.57,0:55:36.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有苹果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the apples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.70,0:55:38.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来一个吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of those next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.71,0:55:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这有毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's poisoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.05,0:55:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死你特纳小姐是不合常理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There would be no sense to be killing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.32,0:55:53.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就放了我 你已经得到那件东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release me. You have your trinket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.98,0:55:56.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你再也没用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm of no further value to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.79,0:56:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这是什么 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what this is, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.43,0:56:05.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是海盗金币{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pirate medallion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.16,0:56:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是阿兹泰克金牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Aztec gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.67,0:56:11.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,882块相同的金牌之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of 882 identical pieces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.27,0:56:15.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原本是装在石箱运给科顿自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they delivered in a stone chest to Cortes himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:18.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些钱是为了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood money paid to stem the slaughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.24,0:56:20.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他带领的军队屠杀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he wreaked upon them with his armies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.94,0:56:24.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但科顿贪得无厌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the greed of Cortes was insatiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.35,0:56:32.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以那些异教徒的神给这些金牌 下了可怕的咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the heathen gods placed upon the gold a terrible curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.92,0:56:34.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any mortal that removes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.59,0:56:37.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从石箱里仅拿出一块金牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a single piece from that stone chest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.06,0:56:41.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将被永远地惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall be punished for eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.97,0:56:46.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不再信鬼怪的故事 巴博萨船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hardly believe in ghost stories anymore, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.40,0:56:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们第一次听到这个传说的时候 我们也像你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I thought when we were told the tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.08,0:56:54.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金牌埋在一个无法找到的岛屿上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buried on an island of dead what cannot be found,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.91,0:56:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了那些知道地点的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except for those who know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.52,0:57:00.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们成功地找到了它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find it, we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.52,0:57:03.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,石箱里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There be the chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.35,0:57:05.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装满了金牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnside be the gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.79,0:57:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把它们全部据为己有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we took them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.26,0:57:10.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用来买东西 兑换{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent them and traded them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.43,0:57:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将那些金子挥霍在酒食品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and frittered them away on drink and food{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.00,0:57:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有寻欢作乐上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pleasurable company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.83,0:57:21.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们挥霍的越多 我们就越意识到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more we gave them away, the more we came to realize,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.10,0:57:24.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美酒已经无法满足我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the drink would not satisfy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:27.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美食在我们的嘴里变成了灰尘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}food turned to ash in our mouths,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.88,0:57:30.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这世上的所有的寻欢作乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the pleasurable company in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:32.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都无法满足我们的欲望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could not slake our lust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:37.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是被诅咒的人 特纳小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are cursed men, Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.76,0:57:44.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被我们的贪婪驱使着 而现在我们却被它榨干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compelled by greed, we were, but now we are consumed by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.04,0:57:59.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解除咒语的办法只有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one way we can end our curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.91,0:58:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把流落四方的阿兹泰克金币 全都收归一处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the scattered pieces of the Aztec gold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.15,0:58:10.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还要以血还血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must be restored and the blood repaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.32,0:58:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是多谢你了 最后的金币终于到手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to ye, we have the final piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.39,0:58:20.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血债要血偿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the blood to be repaid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.73,0:58:25.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就为什么我们现在 还不杀了你的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why there's no sense to be killin' you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.70,0:58:29.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苹果要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.51,0:58:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arr!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.71,0:58:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.52,0:58:46.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.66,0:58:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我之后你还打算干啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After killing me, what is it you're planning on doing next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.99,0:59:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.32,0:59:58.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,月光让我们原形毕露了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moonlight shows us for what we really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.96,1:00:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们算不上活人 自然也不可能死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not among the living, and so we cannot die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也不是死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But neither are we dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:09.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太久太久了 我渴得要命却无法解渴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For too long I've been parched and unable to quench it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.14,1:00:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太久太久了 我饿得要死却求死不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too long I've been starving to death and haven't died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.08,1:00:16.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我毫无知觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:20.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,风吹到脸上 浪打到身上都没有一丝感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the wind on my face nor the spray of the sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.32,1:00:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更别说温香软玉的女人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor the warmth of a woman's flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.69,1:00:28.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好开始相信那些鬼故事吧 特纳小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You best start believing in ghost stories, Miss Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你正置身其中!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.64,1:00:53.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看什么看? 回去干活!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at? Back to work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.82,1:01:01.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一饱眼福吧 我的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feast your eyes, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.79,1:01:04.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿站着的 全都是忠心耿耿的好水手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them faithful hands before the mast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.43,1:01:07.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是吃这碗饭长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every man worth his salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.83,1:01:09.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且全都够疯的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And crazy to boot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.90,1:01:13.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是你身强力壮的船员吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is your able-bodied crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.94,1:01:21.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你 伙计! - 科顿 先生!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You, sailor! - Cotton, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.14,1:01:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿先生 你有服从命令的勇气和毅力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cotton, do you have the courage to follow orders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.91,1:01:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即便面对危险和死亡也忠心不二吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stay true in the face of danger and death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.98,1:01:31.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿先生! 请回答我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cotton! Answer, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.32,1:01:33.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个哑巴.可怜的家伙舌头被人割了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a mute. Poor devil had his tongue cut out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.02,1:01:36.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他训练了一只鹦鹉来代他说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He trained the parrot to talk for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.36,1:01:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么办到的谁也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's yet figured how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.43,1:01:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿先生的鹦鹉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cotton's parrot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.33,1:01:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题你来答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.67,1:01:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,顺风! 顺风!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wind in the sails! Wind in the sails!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.54,1:01:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一般就当这个是"是的"的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mostly we figure that means "yes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.94,1:01:53.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.21,1:01:55.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你满意了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satisfied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.14,1:01:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你证明了他们是一帮疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've proved they're mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:01:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有啥好处啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's the benefit for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.63,1:02:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛利亚啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anamaria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.23,1:02:15.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你这巴掌你又挨冤枉了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you didn't deserve that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.10,1:02:17.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 这不冤枉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that one I deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:19.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你偷了我的船!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole my boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.37,1:02:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.10,1:02:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是借用一下 未经允许的借用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Borrowed. Borrowed without permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.97,1:02:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但一心一意要还给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with every intention of bringing it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.08,1:02:28.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你还了吗? !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you didn't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.64,1:02:31.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会另还一艘给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.58,1:02:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.48,1:02:33.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一艘更好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A better one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.05,1:02:35.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一艘更好的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A better one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.79,1:02:36.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.65,1:02:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪艘?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.26,1:02:42.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.83,1:02:46.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧! 就那艘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.66,1:02:48.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们怎么说? - 赞成!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What say you? - Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.33,1:02:49.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.80,1:02:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下锚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anchors aweigh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.67,1:02:55.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不不 带女人上船会很走霉运的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's frightful bad luck to bring a woman aboard, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.04,1:02:58.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不带上她会更倒霉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt'll be far worse not to have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.94,1:03:35.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用这么一个破指南针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we sail to an island that nobody can find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.61,1:03:37.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么可能驶到 那个没人能找到的小岛啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a compass that doesn't work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.61,1:03:39.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这指南针是不指南了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, the compass doesn't point North,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.78,1:03:43.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可我们也不是要找南在那儿啊 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we're not trying to find North, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.23,1:03:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得撤帆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should drop canvas, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.73,1:03:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再坚持一会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can hold a bit longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.97,1:04:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你都是怎么想的才能这么乐观啊 船长?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in your head that's put you in such a fine mood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.67,1:04:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赶上他们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're catching up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.32,1:04:22.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该上路了 乖乖!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go, poppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.73,1:04:26.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔! 喔! 喔! 喔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.01,1:05:23.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死人不说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead men tell no tales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:26.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好恐怖的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Puts a chill in the bones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.52,1:05:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这条航道要了多少好水手的命啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how many honest sailors have been claimed by this passage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.07,1:05:47.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克的那个指南针怎么来的你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it that Jack came by that compass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.54,1:05:50.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 斯派洛上特图加岛以前的事很少有人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a lot's known about Jack fore he showed up in Tortuga{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.71,1:05:53.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他当时是一心追寻死亡之岛屿的财宝去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a mind to go after the treasure of the lsla de Muerta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.65,1:05:54.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是后来才认识他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was before I'd met him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.98,1:05:57.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他当黑珍珠号船长的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back when he was Captain of the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.05,1:05:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.52,1:06:04.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从来没提到过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He failed to mention that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.26,1:06:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在行事谨慎多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He plays things closer to the vest now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.56,1:06:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很不容易学到的啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a hard-learned lesson it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.69,1:06:11.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,经过三天的探宝 船上的大副来找他说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three days out, the first mate comes to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.23,1:06:13.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们得的财宝应该平分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and says everything's an equal share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.37,1:06:15.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,藏宝点也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should mean the location of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.90,1:06:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克给搞蒙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack gives up the bearings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.27,1:06:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当夜却发生了叛乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That night, there was a mutiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.51,1:06:24.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克被弃置在一个荒岛上等死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They marooned Jack on an island and left him to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.71,1:06:27.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他还没死就被热疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not before he'd gone mad with the heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.15,1:06:33.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这就是为什么他有点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's the reason for all the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.69,1:06:38.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟这根本扯不上关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reason's got nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.19,1:06:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 威尔 被弃置在荒岛的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Will, when a pirate's marooned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.53,1:06:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通常都会给他一把枪的 枪里只有一颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's a given a pistol with a single shot. One shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.66,1:06:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 用来打猎和求助都没太大用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that won't do much good hunting or to be rescued.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:50.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可又饥又渴三个星期下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But after three weeks of a starving belly and thirst,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.37,1:06:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那枪看起来就象个解脱的诱惑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that pistol will start to look real friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.54,1:06:57.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是杰克从荒岛脱了身 并且仍然留着那一颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Jack escaped the island, and he still has that single shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.21,1:07:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他那颗子弹是留给{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he won't use it, though, save on one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.71,1:07:02.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,背叛他的大副的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mutinous first mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.91,1:07:05.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是巴博萨? - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Barbossa. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.08,1:07:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克怎么从荒岛上逃出来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did Jack get off the island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我来告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll tell ye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.49,1:07:11.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他走进了一个浅滩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He waded out into the shallows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.36,1:07:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿呆了三天三夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He waited there three days and three nights{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到每种海洋生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till all manner of sea creatures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.79,1:07:18.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都对他的存在习以为常了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'came acclimated to his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.63,1:07:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在第四天早上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on the fourth morning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.43,1:07:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他用绳子捆住了几只海龟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he roped a couple of sea turtles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.63,1:07:25.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它们扎成了个筏子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lashed them together, and made a raft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.87,1:07:28.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他用绳子捆住了几只海龟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He roped a couple of sea turtles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.71,1:07:31.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 是海龟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, sea turtles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.91,1:07:34.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他哪来的绳子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he use for rope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.12,1:07:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用人的头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.39,1:07:44.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我背上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.19,1:07:46.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下锚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go the anchor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.42,1:07:48.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 船长!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, Captain, aye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.93,1:07:51.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小特纳和我上岸去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Mr. Turner and l are to go ashore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.96,1:07:55.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长! 要是最糟的情况发生了怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, what if the worst should happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.67,1:07:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按法典办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep to the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.87,1:07:58.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是 按法典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.10,1:08:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.36,1:08:27.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们集了十年的宝贝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10 years of hoarding swag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.73,1:08:30.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于等到了可以享用的时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we finally get to spend it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.74,1:08:40.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦解除了咒语 我们就成了阔佬啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we're quit of the curse, we'll be rich men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.71,1:08:44.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以买个大小合适的玻璃眼珠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can buy an eye what actually fits and is made of glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.48,1:08:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这玩艺儿真刺的好难受啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one does splinter something terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.29,1:08:50.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别摸它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop rubbing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.96,1:09:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说的最糟的情况发生时 要守的规矩是什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Code is Gibbs to keep to if the worst should happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.03,1:09:14.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗法典{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate's Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:18.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对落了单的人我们是弃之不顾的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any man who falls behind is left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.54,1:09:22.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗没有英雄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No heroes amongst thieves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.15,1:09:25.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你把海盗们看透的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For having such a bleak outlook on pirates,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.68,1:09:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己就快成为其中一员了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're well on your way to becoming one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.62,1:09:31.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撬开牢门救了个囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sprung a man from jail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.62,1:09:33.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不问自取开走了皇家舰队的一艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}commandeered a ship of the fleet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.06,1:09:37.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和一帮海盗船员扬帆驶到特图加岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sailed with a buccaneer crew out of Tortuga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:42.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还被财宝完全迷倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're completely obsessed with treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.20,1:09:49.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是胡说 我才没被财宝迷住呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true. I am not obsessed with treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.05,1:09:58.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,财宝指的可不光是金子银子 哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all treasure is silver and gold, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.88,1:10:01.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 这天我们终于来临了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, the time has come!.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.25,1:10:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的解救就在前方!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our salvation is nigh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.12,1:10:08.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的苦难就快到头了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our torment is near an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.26,1:10:09.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.93,1:10:12.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十年来我们受尽了考验和试探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For 10 years we've been tested and tried,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.59,1:10:14.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在场的每个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and each man jack of you here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.46,1:10:17.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都无数次地证明了自己的勇气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has proved his mettle a hundred times over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.90,1:10:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无数次啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a hundred times again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.07,1:10:24.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可受够了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suffered, I have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.44,1:10:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经受够了惩罚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punished, we were, the lot of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.84,1:10:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直比我们所犯下的罪还要多得多!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disproportionate to our crime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.15,1:10:35.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这罪行就在这儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.05,1:10:41.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这下了咒语的科顿的宝藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cursed treasure of Cortes himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.36,1:10:48.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一枚散落在外的金币 我们都找回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every last piece that went astray, we have returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.10,1:10:49.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了这一枚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.83,1:10:51.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.33,1:10:55.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不行 我们要等最佳时机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet. We wait for the opportune moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.20,1:10:59.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了881个 但在找最后一个时 我们一次又一次地绝望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}881 we found, but despaired of ever finding the last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.44,1:11:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那要到什么时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.31,1:11:03.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到你最有利可图的时候吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it's of greatest profit to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.91,1:11:06.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你个问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask you something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.72,1:11:10.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给过你任何觉得 我不可信赖的理由吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I ever given you reason not to trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.42,1:11:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do us a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.82,1:11:15.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这对你是桩难事 但拜托你就呆在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's difficult for you, but please stay here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.86,1:11:18.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别做任何傻事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and try not to do anything stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.40,1:11:25.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们中 有谁已为信奉邪神偿清血祭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who among us has paid the blood sacrifice owed to the heathen gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.60,1:11:26.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:29.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么还有谁的血尚未献祭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whose blood must yet be paid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.24,1:11:30.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.21,1:11:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 等诅咒解除之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the first thing I'm gonna do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.51,1:11:38.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要做的第一件事是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the curse is lifted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.95,1:11:43.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是吃掉整整一堆苹果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat a whole bushel of apples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.09,1:11:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血的咒语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begun by blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.26,1:11:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要以血解开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By blood undone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.67,1:12:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 杰克 我可不想被你利用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Jack. I'm not gonna be your leverage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.68,1:12:14.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.98,1:12:16.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都别浪费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waste not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.59,1:12:55.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有作用吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.66,1:12:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没感觉有什么变化啊? - 我们如何判断呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't feel no different. - How do we tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.83,1:13:08.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.60,1:13:10.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.37,1:13:12.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然开枪射我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.41,1:13:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有起作用!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.98,1:13:16.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们身上的诅咒还在!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The curse it still upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.65,1:13:23.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你 姑娘! 你的父亲叫什么名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, maid! Your father, what was his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.55,1:13:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲是不是叫威廉 特纳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was your father William Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.42,1:13:27.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.46,1:13:31.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个八年前坐船 离开英格兰的孩子在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's his child that sailed from England eight years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.13,1:13:34.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个具有威廉 特纳血统的孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The child in whose veins flows the blood of William Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.80,1:13:43.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.91,1:13:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩给我们找了个冒牌货!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought us the wrong person!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.31,1:13:48.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.68,1:13:51.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她有那块金币 而且她年纪也正相当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had the medallion. She's the proper age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.55,1:13:54.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她的名字叫特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said her name was Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.05,1:13:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she lied to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.12,1:14:02.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我们来这里白跑一趟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought us here for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.99,1:14:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想问也不想再猜了 提格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't take questioning or second guesses from you, Twigg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.69,1:14:07.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想推脱责任?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's to blame?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:11.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的每个决定 都让我们的情况变得更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every decision you've made has led us from bad to worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.67,1:14:15.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你把系带王推进了深渊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you who sent Bootstrap to the depths!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.80,1:14:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.64,1:14:22.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又是你把我们带到这里来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's you who brought us here in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.01,1:14:28.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有哪个懦夫敢挑战我的 上来开口啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any coward here dare challenge me, let him speak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.88,1:14:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,依我看 我们不妨割断她的喉咙把血放光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we cut her throat and spill all her blood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.72,1:14:33.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许那样有效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just in case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.66,1:14:35.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.73,1:14:44.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金币!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The medallion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.03,1:14:46.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她拿走了金币!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's taken it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.43,1:14:50.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去追她 你们这群忘恩负义的东西!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get after her, you feckless pack of ingrates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.88,1:14:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,桨都不见了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No oars here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.64,1:14:59.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,桨呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the oars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.08,1:15:01.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,桨都不见了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oars have gone missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.35,1:15:03.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快找!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.79,1:15:08.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去找桨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the oars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.39,1:15:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.33,1:15:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该是死了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.23,1:15:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有死吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.48,1:15:30.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕鲁类!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Palulay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.25,1:15:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕鲁-力-拉-拉-鲁鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Palu-li-la-la-lulu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.08,1:15:36.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕力力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parlili.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.95,1:15:42.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕思力 帕思勒 帕特 帕特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parsnip, parsley, partner, partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.09,1:15:42.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕雷?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.92,1:15:45.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 帕雷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the one! Parley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.33,1:15:46.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕雷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.56,1:15:48.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕雷?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:53.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 是谁想出"帕雷"这个点子来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn to the depths whatever man that thought up "parley"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.77,1:15:56.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是法国佬吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be the French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.32,1:16:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别又是海盗啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not more pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.92,1:16:12.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎上船 伊丽莎白小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard, Miss Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.89,1:16:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉布斯先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gibbs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.66,1:16:16.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 孩子! 杰克在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boy, where be Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:18.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.53,1:16:21.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 斯派洛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.16,1:16:23.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他落在后面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.00,1:16:31.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按规矩行事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep to the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.94,1:16:34.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起锚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weigh anchor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.31,1:16:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,升帆! 动作快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hoist the sails! Make quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.45,1:16:47.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个该死的东西 是怎么逃离那荒岛的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the blazes did you get off that island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.02,1:16:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你把我放逐到 那个荒凉的小岛上时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you marooned me on that godforsaken spit of land,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.49,1:16:54.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘记了一件非常重要的事情 朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you forgot one very important thing, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.70,1:16:58.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰克 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.77,1:17:03.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好吧 我不会再犯同样的错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I won't be making that mistake again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.54,1:17:06.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 你们还记得杰克斯派洛船长吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gents, you all remember Captain Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.64,1:17:08.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.04,1:17:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.85,1:17:14.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那女孩的血没有用 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl's blood didn't work, did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.52,1:17:18.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.49,1:17:27.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道谁才是我们要找的人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know whose blood we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.76,1:17:31.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们要找的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know whose blood you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.60,1:17:40.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的人会以命换船?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of a man trades a man's life for a ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.50,1:17:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.67,1:17:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个让我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.77,1:17:47.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.74,1:17:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在巴博萨面前冒用我的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you gave Barbossa my name as yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.41,1:17:54.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.42,1:17:58.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.66,1:18:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 铁匠的手都这样 很粗糙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Blacksmith's hands. I know they're rough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.66,1:18:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不...我的意思是 他们的确粗糙...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I mean yes, they are, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.10,1:18:13.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不用停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.38,1:18:22.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.76,1:18:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.40,1:18:46.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为他们救我上来那天弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd lost it the day they rescued me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.97,1:18:49.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我父亲的礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a gift from my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.47,1:18:51.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.68,1:18:57.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么拿走它?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you take it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.78,1:19:03.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我担心你是一个海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was afraid that you were a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.22,1:19:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would have been awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.42,1:19:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要的不是你的血...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't your blood they needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.90,1:19:16.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是我父亲的血...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my father's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.63,1:19:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.17,1:19:27.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个海盗的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood of a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.74,1:19:30.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 请原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, I'm so sorry. Please forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.26,1:19:45.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你打算告诉我那个人的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect to leave me on some beach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.36,1:19:48.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把我留在岸上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with nothing but a name and your word it's the one I need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.66,1:19:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就这样 看你开着我的船扬长而去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and watch you sail away in my ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.40,1:19:53.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.47,1:19:55.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算把你先丢到岸上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect to leave you standing on some beach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.00,1:19:57.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也不告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with absolutely no name at all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.84,1:20:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等到我开船走远后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching me sail away on my ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.48,1:20:02.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我才会把那个名字喊给你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I'll shout the name back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.94,1:20:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.35,1:20:07.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果我站在沙滩上听你叫喊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That still leaves the problem of me on some beach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.08,1:20:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许根本就听不到我要找的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with naught but a name and your word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.48,1:20:11.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那人的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the one I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.05,1:20:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们俩之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the two of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.92,1:20:17.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我是没有参与叛变的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the only one who hasn't committed mutiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.63,1:20:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我的话值得相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, my word is the one we'll be trusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.70,1:20:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我想我还是应该谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, I suppose I should be thanking you because, in fact,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.20,1:20:29.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是你出卖了我 把我丢在荒岛上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you hadn't betrayed me and left me to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.37,1:20:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也许会和你们一同 承受那可怕的诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have an equal share in that curse, same as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:35.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是个有趣的世界 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny old world, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.25,1:20:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长 我们追上阻击者号了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, we're coming up on the Interceptor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.86,1:20:57.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个建议 巴博萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a thought here, Barbossa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.53,1:20:59.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先暂时升起休战旗如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What say we run up a flag of truce,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.53,1:21:01.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到阻击者号上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I scurry over to the Interceptor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.44,1:21:05.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和他们谈判拿回你的金币 好不好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I negotiate the return of your medallion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.27,1:21:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 现在你应该明白 正是这种软弱让你失去了黑珍珠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's exactly the attitude that lost you the Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.34,1:21:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等人死了以后再找他们就容易多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are easy to search when they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.25,1:21:15.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他关进禁闭室!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock him in the brig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.33,1:21:29.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把帆全张开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands aloft to loose t'gallants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.43,1:21:32.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这样这样风力下 它很容易就能赶上我们的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this wind, she'll carry every sail we've got!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.70,1:21:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.80,1:21:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠号 她赶上我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl, She's gaining on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.34,1:21:43.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是加勒比海上速度最快的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the fastest ship in the Caribbean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.31,1:21:46.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等他们抓住我们以后你再说这些吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell them that after they've caught us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.45,1:21:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的船吃水浅 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're shallower on the draft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:49.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.22,1:21:52.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么不逃进那片沙洲甩掉他们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then can't we lose them amongst those shoals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.29,1:21:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用不了多久就会追上来 我们赶不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to outrun them long, just long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.06,1:21:58.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,减轻负重 从船头到船尾!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lighten the ship, stem to stern!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.66,1:22:02.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把能丢的都丢掉 就当损失好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything we can afford to lose, see that it's lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.37,1:22:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然这里漏水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, there's a leak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.02,1:22:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉起主帆横索 大炮准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haul on the main brace! Make ready the guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.46,1:22:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伸出长桨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And run out the sweeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.43,1:22:36.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉! - 呼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull! - Ho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.49,1:23:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们真要干一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.57,1:23:13.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到现在看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a good plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.20,1:23:14.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这仍然是个好计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up till now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.80,1:23:16.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉布斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.14,1:23:17.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要坚定自己的立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to make a stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.04,1:23:19.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须战斗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.04,1:23:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大炮装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load the guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.28,1:23:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.44,1:23:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何东西 所有东西!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything. Everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.41,1:23:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要是我们手上还有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything we have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.82,1:23:29.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,装弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load the guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.82,1:23:31.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,容器或者是钉弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Case shot and langrage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.55,1:23:33.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钉子和碎玻璃片!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nails and crushed glass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:37.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随你们便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.25,1:24:00.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠很快就要 从左舷船尾赶上来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pearl's gonna luff up on our port quarter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.05,1:24:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她会毫不费力地把我们撞个稀烂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll rake us without ever presenting a target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.85,1:24:05.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,右边船舷下锚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower the anchor on the right side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.49,1:24:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,右边船舷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the starboard side!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.69,1:24:10.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这招肯定能让他们大吃一惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has the element of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.53,1:24:13.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你蠢到家了 小姐! 你们俩都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're daft, lady! You both are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.13,1:24:15.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像杰克一样愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daft like Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.13,1:24:17.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,右舷下锚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower the starboard anchor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.43,1:24:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋快动 否则就把你们也装进大炮里!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, you dogs, or it's you we'll load into the cannons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.39,1:24:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放舵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.16,1:24:49.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在放锚急转!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're clubhauling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.50,1:24:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,左舷急转! 收回右舷长桨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to port! Rack the starboard oars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.83,1:24:54.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,左舷急转!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to port!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都站稳了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep us steady, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.25,1:25:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.39,1:25:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.49,1:25:17.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.20,1:25:29.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别把我的船打得满是窟窿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop blowing holes in my ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.65,1:26:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快想点更好的办法 小姑娘!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could use a few more ideas, lass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.28,1:26:18.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该你了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.42,1:26:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要有恶魔一般的天份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need us a devil's dowry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.76,1:26:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把她交出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll give them her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.06,1:26:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的目标不是她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not what they're after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.16,1:26:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金币{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The medallion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.75,1:26:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现出你们的真功夫来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raise your colors, you bloomin' cockroaches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.25,1:26:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水手们! 准备格斗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands, grapnels, at the ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.06,1:26:58.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接舷战!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to board!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.19,1:27:34.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们炸个粉碎吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast all to carcasses, men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.63,1:27:36.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去炸他们的弹药舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forward clear to the powder magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.90,1:27:42.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其它人把金币给我抢回来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rest of you, bring me that medallion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.04,1:27:51.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.41,1:27:53.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.30,1:28:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Below!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.39,1:28:33.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.90,1:28:47.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.24,1:28:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酒壶都空了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.87,1:28:55.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.72,1:29:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样很不文雅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.46,1:29:13.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金币在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the medallion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.73,1:29:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下流胚!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wretch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.93,1:29:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的威廉在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's dear William?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.17,1:29:22.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.47,1:29:25.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.64,1:29:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.31,1:29:32.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猴子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.85,1:29:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搬不动它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.75,1:29:40.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.79,1:29:42.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.09,1:29:43.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.54,1:29:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很感谢你 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, thank you, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.67,1:29:59.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.37,1:30:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说你 我们的这只猴子也叫杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you. We named the monkey "Jack."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.14,1:30:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 我们的希望又回来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gents, our hope is restored!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.78,1:30:46.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们如果还想要求帕雷的权利的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of you so much as thinks the word "parley,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.19,1:30:49.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就一枪毙了你们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have your guts for garters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.63,1:30:58.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.30,1:31:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要去阻止它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.97,1:31:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 住手! - 欢迎回来 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it! - Welcome back, miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.24,1:31:05.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上次你卑劣地利用了 我们的盛情好客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took advantage of our hospitality last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.04,1:31:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你也该得到回报 这很公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It holds fair now you return the favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.15,1:31:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴博萨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbossa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.42,1:31:20.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.12,1:31:24.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放她走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She goes free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.39,1:31:26.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你想怎么样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in your head, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.39,1:31:28.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放她走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She goes free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.73,1:31:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只有一发子弹 可我们都是不死之躯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've only got one shot, and we can't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.57,1:31:34.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别做蠢事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do anything stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.54,1:31:39.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.24,1:31:40.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.91,1:31:43.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.51,1:31:46.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.45,1:31:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无名小辈 他是个小人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one. He's no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.05,1:31:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我婶婶的一个远房表亲的侄儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A distant cousin of my aunt's nephew twice removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.59,1:31:53.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过他唱歌很好听 是个娘娘腔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely singing voice, though. Eunuch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.75,1:31:55.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫威尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Will Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.46,1:31:58.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲是比尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was Bootstrap Bill Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.26,1:32:00.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的血管里流淌着他的血液{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His blood runs in my veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.93,1:32:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是比尔的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the spitting image of old Bootstrap Bill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:05.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个总是缠着我们的比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come back to haunt us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.17,1:32:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按我说的做 否则我就扣扳机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my word, do as I say, or I'll pull this trigger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.14,1:32:12.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就消失在这茫茫大海里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and be lost to Davy Jones' locker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.41,1:32:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说说你的条件 特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name your terms, Mr. Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.78,1:32:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放伊丽莎白走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth goes free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.98,1:32:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们知道了 还有别的条件吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we know that one. Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.52,1:32:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有船员 不许伤害他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the crew. The crew are not to be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.56,1:32:31.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.46,1:32:38.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖孩子 快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, poppet, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.03,1:32:40.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走上去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk the plank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.58,1:32:54.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴博萨 你这个撒谎的杂种! 你答应了放她走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbossa, you lying bastard! You swore she'd go free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.35,1:32:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别诋毁我的信誉 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't dare impugn me honor, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.18,1:32:58.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是同意放她走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agreed she'd go free,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.82,1:33:02.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你也没说在什么地方和什么时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it was you who failed to specify when or where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:11.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过失去这样一位尤物 实在令人惋惜 是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though does seem a shame to lose something so fine, don't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.87,1:33:13.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.47,1:33:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你走之前能把衣服还给我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll be having that dress back before you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.04,1:33:22.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都很喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always liked you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.38,1:33:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见你的鬼去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goes with your black heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.65,1:33:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 还带点体温{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, it's still warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.69,1:33:36.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你快跳啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.86,1:33:38.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.86,1:33:43.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真麻烦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too long!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.17,1:33:57.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真心希望大家能够尽释前嫌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really rather hoped we were past all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.08,1:34:01.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.52,1:34:03.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有注意到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you not notice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.05,1:34:09.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是当初我们把 你丢下的那个小岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That be the same island we made you governor of on our last little trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.02,1:34:11.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.36,1:34:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你能再创一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'll be able to conjure up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.86,1:34:15.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死里逃生的奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another miraculous escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.56,1:34:17.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我表示非常怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I doubt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.03,1:34:21.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.67,1:34:22.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.60,1:34:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上次你给我留了一把单发手枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, you left me a pistol with one shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.27,1:34:27.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷 对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the powers, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.37,1:34:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克的枪在那里 拿过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where be Jack's pistol? Bring it forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.01,1:34:37.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到我们有两个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seeing as there's two of us, a gentleman would give us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.48,1:34:38.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一位绅士也许应该给我两把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a pair of pistols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.82,1:34:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和以前一样 只有一把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt'll be one pistol as before,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.59,1:34:43.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你尽可以扮演绅士先把那位女士打死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be the gentleman and shoot the lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.09,1:34:46.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后自己也饿死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and starve to death yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.58,1:35:10.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我第二次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the second time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.75,1:35:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,眼看着有人开走我的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had to watch that man sail away with my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.95,1:35:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前也被放逐到这个岛上 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were marooned on this island before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.62,1:35:20.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们仍可以用你当初的法子逃跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can escape the same way you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.29,1:35:23.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样又有什么用呢 小姐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what point and purpose, young missy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.23,1:35:25.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠已经开走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.20,1:35:28.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非在你的衣服里 还藏着一个舵轮和几张帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you have a rudder and sails hidden in that bodice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.83,1:35:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来那是不太可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.10,1:35:34.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而在我们追上他们之前 小特纳大概早死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Mr. Turner will be dead long before you can reach him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.94,1:35:38.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你是杰克 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.01,1:35:42.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能在东印度公司的 7个特工眼皮子底下溜掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You vanished from seven agents of the East lndia Company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.98,1:35:46.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不费一枪一弹就洗劫了整个拿骚港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sacked Nassau Port without even firing a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.08,1:35:49.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的还是我所知道的那个大海盗吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you the pirate I've read about or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.02,1:35:52.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你上次是怎么逃脱的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you escape last time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.70,1:36:04.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上一次... 我在这里只待了三天 明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time, I was here a grand total of three days, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.34,1:36:06.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上一次...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.37,1:36:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走私酒贩子们把这座岛 当成一个秘密仓库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rumrunners used this island as a cache,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.41,1:36:14.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来到这里装货 我好求歹求终于才能搭船离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came by, and I was able to barter passage off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.45,1:36:15.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这些东西的情况来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the looks of things,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.85,1:36:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里已经很久没有人来过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they've long been out of business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.25,1:36:22.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这都要归功于你那位朋友 诺灵顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably have your bloody friend Norrington to thank for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.35,1:36:26.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么就是这样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.19,1:36:28.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是伟大的杰克 斯派洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the secret grand adventure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.33,1:36:30.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所谓的惊天动地的冒险经历?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the infamous Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.93,1:36:35.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在沙滩上躺了三天 喝着兰姆酒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent three days lying on a beach, drinking rum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.10,1:36:40.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到加勒比 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Caribbean, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.41,1:36:51.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我们是恶魔和黑绵羊 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ We're devils, we're black sheep ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.08,1:36:52.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我们是地地道道的大坏蛋 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ We're really bad eggs ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.68,1:36:54.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 让我一醉解千愁! ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Drink up, me hearties, yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.02,1:36:56.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 哟吼 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Yo ho, yo ho ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.95,1:36:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.96,1:36:59.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 为我的海盗生涯而欢呼! ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A pirate's life for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.39,1:37:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这首歌!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this song!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.39,1:37:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地地道道的大坏蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really bad eggs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.50,1:37:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.44,1:37:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我夺回黑珍珠之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get the Pearl back,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:16.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要教会每个船员都唱它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna teach it to the whole crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.11,1:37:17.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要随时随地唱它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll sing it all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.74,1:37:21.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样你就会成为西班牙大陆上 家喻户晓的海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be the most fearsome pirate in the Spanish Main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.68,1:37:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是西班牙 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just the Spanish Main, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.55,1:37:26.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个海洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.18,1:37:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.92,1:37:32.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想去哪里就去哪里 这就是船的真正含义 你明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever we want to go, we go. That's what a ship is, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.59,1:37:35.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可不仅仅是有条龙骨 有个船壳 有层甲板 有几张船上所必需的帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just a keel and a deck and sails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.49,1:37:36.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一艘船的真正含义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what a ship needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.06,1:37:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠真正的含义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what a ship is, what the Black Pearl really is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.84,1:37:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.94,1:37:53.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 当你被困在这岛上时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, it must be really terrible for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.14,1:37:55.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那种感觉一定非常可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be trapped on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.68,1:37:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.08,1:38:01.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这次比上次好多了 有个伴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the company is infinitely better than last time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.52,1:38:02.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.45,1:38:06.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,风景也优美多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scenery has definitely improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.76,1:38:08.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯派洛先生 - 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Sparrow. - Mm-hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.33,1:38:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有醉到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not entirely sure I've had enough rum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.93,1:38:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想听你这些陈词滥调{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to allow that kind of talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.03,1:38:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你什么意思 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly what you mean, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.31,1:38:24.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了自由!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.48,1:38:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了黑珍珠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.88,1:39:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Not good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.31,1:39:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手! 不好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Not good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.98,1:39:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.18,1:39:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把所有的货物都烧了 整个酒窖 兰姆酒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burned all the food, the shade! The rum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.85,1:39:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 没有兰姆酒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the rum is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.59,1:39:11.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不要兰姆酒了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is the rum gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.39,1:39:13.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 因为这种邪恶的饮料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, because it is a vile drink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.22,1:39:16.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以把最受尊敬的人 彻底变成一个恶棍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that turns even the most respectable men into scoundrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.13,1:39:19.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第二 燃烧的烟火 可以升到上千英尺高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, that signal is over a thousand feet high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.30,1:39:21.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而整个皇家海军都在找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire Royal Navy is looking for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.60,1:39:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你以为他们不会看到?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think there is the slightest chance they won't see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.30,1:39:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么要把兰姆酒也烧了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why is the rum gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.11,1:39:30.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只管等待吧 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait, Captain Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.21,1:39:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我注意看一个小时 也许两个小时 以你的眼力 你很快就会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give it one hour, maybe two, and you will see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.04,1:39:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水平线上的白色船帆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}white sails on that horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.29,1:39:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"当你被困在这岛上时 一定感觉非常可怕 杰克"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Must've been terrible for you to be trapped here, Jack."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.26,1:39:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在才是真的可怕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it bloody is now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.57,1:39:58.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次以后再也不想跟她打交道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be no living with her after this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.87,1:40:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但我们必须去救威尔! - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we've got to save Will. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.90,1:40:02.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在已经安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.74,1:40:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要立刻返回罗耶港{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will return to Port Royal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.51,1:40:06.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是和海盗们搅到一起!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not go gallivanting after pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.54,1:40:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他推向了死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we condemn him to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.71,1:40:12.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子的结局令人惋惜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy's fate is regrettable,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.58,1:40:15.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他自甘堕落 卷入了海盗们的肮脏勾当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but so was his decision to engage in piracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.19,1:40:18.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是为了救我 为了不让我受折磨!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To rescue me. To prevent anything from happening to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.96,1:40:22.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请允许我斗胆插入 一点专业人士的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may be so bold as to inject my professional opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.53,1:40:25.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠在那次战斗以后已经是千疮百孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pearl was listing near to scuppers after the battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.60,1:40:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是她最虚弱的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very unlikely she'll be able to make good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.60,1:40:30.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再考虑一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.50,1:40:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.50,1:40:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加勒比海上的最后一艘海盗船 朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last real pirate threat in the Caribbean, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.84,1:40:39.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会错过这个机会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you pass that up, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.94,1:40:43.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛先生 我是在尽职效忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By remembering that I serve others, Mr. Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.81,1:40:45.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是为我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.22,1:40:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,司令官 我求你了 拜托了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore, I beg you, please do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.52,1:40:48.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.02,1:40:51.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就当是求婚的彩礼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a wedding gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.39,1:40:53.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.59,1:40:56.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你接受司令官的求婚了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you accepting the commodore's proposal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.90,1:41:00.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.16,1:41:01.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一场婚礼! 我爱婚礼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wedding! I love weddings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.07,1:41:03.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家喝个痛快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drinks all around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.20,1:41:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.40,1:41:09.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"把他拷起来" 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Clap him in irons," right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.58,1:41:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛先生 你要到掌舵水手那里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sparrow, you will accompany these fine men to the helm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.85,1:41:19.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他们找到通往乱礁的方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and provide us with a bearing to lsla de Muerta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.08,1:41:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在旅途中闲下来的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will spend the rest of the voyage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.75,1:41:23.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好多想想这句话的含义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}contemplating all meanings of the phrase{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.25,1:41:25.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"沉默是金"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"silent as the grave."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.52,1:41:27.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听清楚我的话了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I make myself clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.16,1:41:29.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直不能再清楚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnescapably clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.26,1:41:36.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨触礁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shiver me timbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.53,1:41:38.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿说你弄歪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cotton here says you missed a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.97,1:41:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识威廉 特纳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew William Turner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.08,1:41:48.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ol' Bootstrap Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.65,1:41:50.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.51,1:41:54.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们像对杰克斯派洛那样反叛布斯特拉普 这辈子都别想过安稳日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sat well with Bootstrap, what we did to Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.55,1:41:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是叛变还是其他什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mutiny and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.15,1:41:59.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他总说这不符合法典的规定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it wasn't right with the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.06,1:42:04.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他把一块金币给了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he sent off a piece of the treasure to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.83,1:42:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说我们活该受到诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said we deserved to be cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.57,1:42:10.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且永远不能被解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remain cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.70,1:42:11.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid blighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.80,1:42:13.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.20,1:42:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, as you can imagine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.37,1:42:19.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和船长在一起的日子也不好过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that didn't sit too well with the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.28,1:42:22.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和船长在一起的日子更糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That didn't sit too well with the captain at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.58,1:42:26.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉他巴博萨干了些什么! - 是我在说这个故事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell him what Barbossa did. - I'm telling the story!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.55,1:42:32.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...船长干了件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what the captain did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.49,1:42:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把老比尔捆在一尊铁炮上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He strapped a cannon to Bootstrap's bootstraps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.86,1:42:39.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们最后一次看到老比尔 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And last we saw of Ol' Bill Turner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.00,1:42:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就这么沉进了汪洋大海里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was sinking to the crushing, black oblivion of Davy Jones' locker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.30,1:42:48.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而在那之后不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Course it was only after that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.07,1:42:51.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就发现只有他的血 才能拯救我们脱离诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we learned we needed his blood to lift the curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.07,1:42:53.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太讽刺了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you call ironic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.38,1:42:59.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带他出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.29,1:43:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不喜欢这里的地形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care for the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.49,1:43:12.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何想冲进洞穴的人都会遭到伏击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any attempt to storm the caves could turn to an ambush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.13,1:43:15.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是伏击者就不会那么悲观了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you're the one doing the ambushing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.53,1:43:19.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我进去劝说巴博萨 和他的手下出来上小船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I convince Barbossa to send his men out with their little boats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.74,1:43:21.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your mates return to the Dauntless{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.04,1:43:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回无畏号开炮轰他们 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and blast the bejesus out of them with your little cannons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.47,1:43:27.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会有什么损失呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you have to lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.78,1:43:31.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没什么好担心的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing I'd lament being rid of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.88,1:43:34.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我有句话想坦诚相告...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, to be quite honest with you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.58,1:43:36.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些还在无畏者号上的人 可能会有危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a risk to those aboard the Dauntless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.59,1:43:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其中包括未来的司令夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which includes the future Mrs. Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.16,1:43:42.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 为了您的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, but it's for your own safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.39,1:43:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不管司令官下了什么命令 我必须告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The commodore ordered! I have to tell him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.83,1:43:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.13,1:43:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们被诅咒了! 他们是不死之躯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're cursed! They can't be killed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.10,1:43:50.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 小姐 他已经知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. He's informed of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.33,1:43:54.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有只美人鱼跳到甲板上来 把一切都告诉了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mermaid flopped up on deck and told him the whole story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.57,1:43:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是杰克 斯派洛的阴谋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Jack Sparrow's doing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.98,1:44:09.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reason to fret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.42,1:44:12.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是割破手指头放点血而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a prick of the finger. A few drops of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.45,1:44:14.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次别再犯错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No mistakes this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.16,1:44:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他只能算半个特纳 我们给他来个大放血!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's only half Turner. We spill it all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.96,1:44:21.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来真有点担心的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess there is reason to fret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.71,1:44:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦借光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon. Beg your pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.85,1:44:39.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 因血而起... - 打扰了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Begun by blood. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.75,1:44:42.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由血而...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By blood ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.15,1:44:46.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.86,1:44:47.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.06,1:44:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不太可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not probable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.79,1:44:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.33,1:44:55.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她很安全 正如我所保证的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's safe, just like I promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.90,1:44:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她正准备嫁给诺灵顿 正如她所许诺的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's set to marry Norrington, like she promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.73,1:45:01.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你就得要为她而死 正如你所许诺的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get to die for her, like you promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.14,1:45:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以说我们都是些信守诺言的男子汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're all men of our word, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.87,1:45:06.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要排除伊丽莎白在外 因为她是个女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for Elizabeth who is, in fact, a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.74,1:45:09.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你就是下一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! You're next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.18,1:45:14.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该那样做 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to be doing that, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.45,1:45:17.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我认为我应该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I really think I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.19,1:45:20.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的葬礼而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.43,1:45:25.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我不该那样做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I want to be doing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.96,1:45:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.86,1:45:32.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为无畏号 皇家海军的骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the HMS Dauntless, pride of the Royal Navy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.04,1:45:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此刻正停泊在外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is floating just offshore, waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.22,1:45:47.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.15,1:45:53.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等海盗们出来...打他们个措手不及{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pirates come out, unprepared and unawares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.26,1:45:58.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用交叉火力放倒他们 送他们回老家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We catch them in a crossfire, send them down to see Old Hob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.93,1:46:00.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们来这里的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.70,1:46:02.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 为什么我们 不照斯派洛先生说的行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant, why aren't we doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.43,1:46:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用大炮一劳永逸解决他们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what Mr. Sparrow said we should do with the cannons and all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.37,1:46:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是斯派洛说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it was Mr. Sparrow who said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.64,1:46:15.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为他说的是真话吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think he wasn't telling the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.24,1:46:17.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请听我说 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hear me out, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.51,1:46:19.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你命令你的手下潜水登上无畏者号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You order your men to row to the Dauntless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.75,1:46:21.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们放开手脚大干一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do what they do best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.95,1:46:23.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鱼归鱼 虾归虾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robert's your uncle. Fannie's your aunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.02,1:46:26.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就有两艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are with two ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.79,1:46:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拥有自己的舰队了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The makings of your very own fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.06,1:46:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然你可以选大船当旗舰 有谁会和你争呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll take the grandest as your flagship, and who's to argue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.73,1:46:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是黑珍珠怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what of the Pearl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.83,1:46:37.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来当船长吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name me captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.67,1:46:40.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在你的麾下效劳 抢来的东西上交一成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sail under your colors. I'll give you 10% of me plunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.67,1:46:46.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你就自封为舰队司令 巴博萨 撒维司令?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you get to introduce yourself as Commodore Barbossa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.72,1:46:47.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savvy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.72,1:46:51.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你是想让我别杀这个小崽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose in exchange, you want me not to kill the whelp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.42,1:46:54.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 根本不是这样 尽管杀他好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Not at all. By all means, kill the whelp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.59,1:46:56.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.96,1:47:02.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等诅咒解除之后找个适当的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait to lift the curse until the opportune moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.80,1:47:07.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比如说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.67,1:47:12.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你消灭了诺灵顿的手下之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you've killed Norrington's men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.18,1:47:17.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every last one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.69,1:47:29.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从开始就策划好了这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been planning this from the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.29,1:47:31.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你知道我的名字之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since you learned my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.36,1:47:32.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.77,1:47:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你劫掠收入的五成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want 50% of your plunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.60,1:47:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一成五 - 四成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 15%. - 40%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.10,1:47:40.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二成五{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}25%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.21,1:47:41.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你买顶帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll buy you the hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.61,1:47:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的大帽子 准将大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A really big one, Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.38,1:47:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说定了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an accord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.32,1:47:53.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人登船!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hands to the boats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.85,1:47:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.05,1:47:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你来下命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give the orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.92,1:48:03.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绅士们 出去走走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gents, take a walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.67,1:48:09.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不上小船?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to the boats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.76,1:49:09.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.80,1:49:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就像希腊人进攻特洛伊一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is just like what the Greeks done at Troy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.07,1:49:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过希腊人躲在马里 而不是化妆成女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except they was in a horse instead of dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.97,1:49:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是木马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wooden horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.22,1:49:36.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我进去一会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A moment, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.46,1:49:41.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.70,1:49:47.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.53,1:49:50.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天作了一个非常正确的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you made a very good decision today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.60,1:49:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我深深为你感到骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't be more proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.74,1:49:55.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道吗 即使是一个正确的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, even a good decision,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.01,1:49:59.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是源于错误的动机 那它也有可能变成一个错误的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if made for the wrong reasons, can be a wrong decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.48,1:50:08.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look into that. Report back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.22,1:50:09.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上尉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.16,1:50:18.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哟吼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yoo-hoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.44,1:50:29.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.68,1:50:33.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.25,1:50:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白 你在听我说话吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth, are you even listening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.14,1:51:07.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你干了什么啊? !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.15,1:51:08.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦! - 不要这样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oooh! - Stop that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.91,1:51:11.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉自己像个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already feel like a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.62,1:51:13.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你看起来很迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look nice, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.49,1:51:19.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look nice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.86,1:51:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须承认 杰克 我本来自以为把你看透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must admit, Jack, I thought I had you figured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.30,1:52:02.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可你仍然是一个难以捉摸的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it turns out you're a hard man to predict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.43,1:52:04.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我? 我不算诚实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I'm dishonest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.44,1:52:07.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我这样一个不守信的人 你应该习惯对我的忠诚不报太多希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a dishonest man you can always trust to be dishonest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.74,1:52:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.01,1:52:11.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你尤其应该小心那些忠实的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the honest ones you want to watch for,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.54,1:52:13.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你永远不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you can never predict{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.91,1:52:18.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会做出些什么蠢事来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they're going to do something incredibly stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.14,1:52:45.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.22,1:52:53.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的路走到尽头了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're off the edge of the map, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.65,1:52:56.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心怪兽来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here there be monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.73,1:53:03.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,了解!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.46,1:53:05.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想先吃那一部分呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you pick to eat first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.50,1:53:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们现在就可以决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should decide now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.63,1:53:10.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样等时候一到我们就不用忙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so we're ready when the time comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.03,1:53:36.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.95,1:53:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.05,1:54:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.14,1:54:23.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回船上去! 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make for the ship! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.75,1:54:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大船!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.35,1:54:38.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快划!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Row, men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.79,1:55:18.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你别想打赢我 杰克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't beat me, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.95,1:55:44.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.30,1:55:56.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,魅力无穷啊 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't resist, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.48,1:56:46.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.67,1:57:03.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.91,1:57:14.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么样 杰克 斯派洛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what now, Jack Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.51,1:57:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个不死的怪物就这么打下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we to be two immortals locked in an epic battle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.35,1:57:20.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直打到世界末日才能有个胜负之分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until judgment day and trumpets sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.89,1:57:22.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你可以考虑投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you could surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.13,1:57:34.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aaaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.38,1:57:50.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都跟我来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.82,1:57:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔还在山洞里 我们得去救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will is in that cave. We must save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.95,1:57:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗? 用力拉啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready. And heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.69,1:58:04.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我需要大家帮助 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I need your help! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.30,1:58:06.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,暴风雨中靠港停泊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any port in a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.86,1:58:09.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科顿没说错 我们已经搞到黑珍珠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cotton's right. We've got the Pearl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.47,1:58:11.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那杰克怎么办 你们就这样丢下他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Jack? Are you gonna leave him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.60,1:58:13.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克欠我们一条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack owes us a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.50,1:58:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有法典参详{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the Code to consider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.61,1:58:16.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法典?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.48,1:58:19.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pirates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.98,1:58:22.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让法典和规矩都见鬼去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang the Code, and hang the rules!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.75,1:58:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些只不过是些指导而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're more like guidelines anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.52,1:58:31.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.60,1:58:42.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿! - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.60,1:58:44.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是计划好的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it supposed to be doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.64,1:58:47.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在偷我们的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're stealing our ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.54,1:58:49.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.21,1:58:53.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,登船者 让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boarders, away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.32,1:59:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.62,1:59:05.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gaaah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.21,1:59:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me eye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.44,1:59:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你知道什么才是痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna teach you the meaning of pain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.64,1:59:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢痛苦吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.91,1:59:58.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就去穿件女式胸衣试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try wearing a corset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.79,2:00:10.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克站在哪一边?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose side is Jack on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.15,2:00:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是问现在?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.46,2:00:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.28,2:01:17.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这支枪跟你有10年了 可惜你在浪费子弹而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten years you carry that pistol, and now you waste your shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.86,2:01:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有浪费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't waste it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.52,2:01:47.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.56,2:01:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.12,2:02:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停战行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.69,2:02:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这艘船是我们的了 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship is ours, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.69,2:03:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胜利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huzzah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.09,2:03:02.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胜利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huzzah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.84,2:03:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该返回无畏号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should return to the Dauntless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.68,2:03:55.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的未婚夫一定急于知道你的安危{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fiance will be wanting to know you're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.02,2:04:09.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还在等待一个好时机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were waiting for the opportune moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.13,2:04:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是刚才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.20,2:04:14.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能施恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd be so kind,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.40,2:04:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将我送到我的船上 我将感激不尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be much obliged if you'd drop me off at my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.67,2:04:24.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.88,2:04:31.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是按道上规矩做的 别指望更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They done what's right by them. Can't expect more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.50,2:04:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"杰克 斯派洛 著名的..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jack Sparrow, be it known that you..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.63,2:04:52.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,船长 杰克 斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain. Captain Jack Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.14,2:04:56.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,“鉴于你对皇室政府所犯下的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"For your willful commission of crimes against the crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.04,2:04:59.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罄竹难书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said crimes being numerous in quantity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.74,2:05:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,令人发指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sinister in nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.18,2:05:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现列举重罪条目如下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most egregious of these to be cited herewith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.98,2:05:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗、走私...”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piracy, smuggling..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.55,2:05:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.92,2:05:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺灵顿司令官必须依法办事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore Norrington is bound by the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.76,2:05:16.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As are we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.36,2:05:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假扮西班牙皇家海军军官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"lmpersonating an officer of the Spanish Royal Navy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.10,2:05:22.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,假扮英格兰教会神职人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lmpersonating a cleric of the church of England."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.27,2:05:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.50,2:05:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伪装他国船只、纵火、绑架、劫掠、偷猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sailing under false colors, arson, kidnapping,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.27,2:05:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,盗窃、腐化堕落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looting, poaching, brigandage, pilfering, depravity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.38,2:05:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,破坏、藐视法律{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depredation, and general lawlessness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.35,2:05:40.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于以上罪行的指控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for these crimes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.75,2:05:43.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今日被判绞刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have been sentenced to be, on this day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.39,2:05:47.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立即处死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hung by the neck until dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.16,2:05:49.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,愿上帝宽恕你的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God have mercy on your soul."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.59,2:05:51.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯旺市长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Governor Swann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.03,2:05:53.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.67,2:05:56.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.03,2:06:00.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你 自从我们相见的那一刻起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have told you every day from the moment I met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.97,2:06:04.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就爱上了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.09,2:06:22.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.23,2:06:23.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喘不过气来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.16,2:06:26.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.13,2:06:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.01,2:06:43.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.59,2:06:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.18,2:07:16.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.68,2:07:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好! - 来啊 年轻人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right! - Come on, lads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.91,2:07:48.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早料到会有人劫法场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we might endure some ill-conceived escape attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.85,2:07:50.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过没想到会是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.38,2:07:54.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当年返回罗耶港途中 我救你一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On our return to Port Royal, I granted you clemency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.25,2:07:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你就这样答谢我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is how you thank me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.99,2:07:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的大好前程都葬送在他身上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By throwing in your lot with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.76,2:07:59.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可是一个海盗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a pirate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.76,2:08:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是一位好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.06,2:08:04.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我所做的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If all I have achieved is the hangman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.03,2:08:08.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是白搭上自己性命 那我也认了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will earn two pairs of boots instead of one, so be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.77,2:08:10.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的良心告诉我这是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My conscience will be clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.60,2:08:14.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘记你的立场了 特纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forget your place, Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.27,2:08:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你和杰克之间我已作出了选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's right here between you and Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.05,2:08:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.11,2:08:25.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.82,2:08:29.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下你们的武器!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.15,2:08:31.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在上帝份上放下枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For goodness sake, put them down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.99,2:08:39.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这才是你的真心所在?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is where your heart truly lies, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.46,2:08:42.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.54,2:08:54.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我不禁要为此拍手叫好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well! I'm actually feeling rather good about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.38,2:08:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想大家正处于一种微妙的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've all arrived at a special place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.98,2:08:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括思维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spiritually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.12,2:09:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世界观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ecumenically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.28,2:09:02.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grammatically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.99,2:09:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你 我绝对支持你 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to know that I was rooting for you, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.72,2:09:08.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.03,2:09:13.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.30,2:09:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在我俩之间这些似乎都不起作用 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would never have worked between us, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.94,2:09:21.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.54,2:09:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.84,2:09:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帽子很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.75,2:09:31.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.98,2:09:37.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天这个日子将会被各位永远记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a day that you will always remember{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.15,2:09:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这一天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the day that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.99,2:09:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 他除了绞架之外无处可去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ldiot. He has nowhere to go but back to the noose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.77,2:09:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有船!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sail ho!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.68,2:10:01.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下一步该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your plan of action?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.95,2:10:03.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.52,2:10:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许在某些时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps on the rare occasion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.85,2:10:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追寻正义之路需要海盗的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pursuing the right course demands an act of piracy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.96,2:10:17.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海盗本身也是一种生存方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}piracy itself can be the right course?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.03,2:10:23.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特纳先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Turner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.34,2:10:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会为我所做的一切承担责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will accept the consequences of my actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.05,2:10:40.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这柄剑很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a beautiful sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.32,2:10:45.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望打造它的人能够在自己的一生中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would expect the man who made it to show the same care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.89,2:10:48.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,展现更多的才华{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in every aspect of his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.83,2:10:52.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.23,2:10:57.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准将!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commodore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.23,2:10:59.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Sparrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.17,2:11:03.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不妨让他先得意些日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think we can afford to give him one day's head start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.61,2:11:10.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.88,2:11:15.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你所选择的道路 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the path you've chosen, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.82,2:11:21.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说 他总算是个铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, he is a blacksmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.79,2:11:23.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.90,2:11:29.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个海盗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.86,2:11:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.44,2:12:09.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你会按法典办事呢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you were supposed to keep to the Code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.44,2:12:13.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只不过觉得那些条文更像是一种指导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We figured they were more actual guidelines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.68,2:12:19.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.45,2:12:22.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯派洛船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Sparrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.16,2:12:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑珍珠号是你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Pearl is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:43.54,2:12:45.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家各就各位!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On deck, you scabrous dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.34,2:12:47.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,转帆索准备!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands to braces!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.14,2:12:49.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...让我们驶向远方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let down and haul to run free!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.98,2:12:55.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自由的一方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, bring me that horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.83,2:13:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地地道道的大坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And really bad eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.56,2:13:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们痛饮吧兄弟们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink up, me hearties, yo ho!{\r}
